  "main_interpretation": "At fixed recipient matching/investment background, bounded allele-mean targeting reproduces the immediate viable maternal effect of the full donor assurance-locus transfer almost exactly across four mating settings and both historical backgrounds. Finite 80-year occupancy effects have discrepancies. The centered donor distribution yields near-zero immediate maternal differences; occupancy can fluctuate in either direction.",
